<title>USA: FORECAST--API inventory estimates for Sept 27 week.</title>
<headline>FORECAST--API inventory estimates for Sept 27 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>(STOCKS IN THOUSAND/BBLS, CHANGES IN MLN/BBLS)</p>
<p>REUTER SURVEY ESTIMATES*	   STOCKS FOR</p>
<p>FOR WEEK ENDED 09/27/96	    WEEK ENDED 09/20/96-CHANGE</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>CRUDE.........DN 1.50 million bbls    306,908	   DN 0.831 MLN</p>
<p>DISTILLATE....UP 1.80 million bbls    112,361	   UP 0.303 MLN</p>
<p>GASOLINE......UP 0.63 million bbls    194,857	   UP 3.062 MLN</p>
<p>UTILIZATION...   UNCHANGED	  95.5 PCT	  UP 0.50 PTS</p>
<p>*The survey estimate is derived by omitting the high and</p>
<p>the low forecast and averaging the rest.</p>
</text>
